--- NNP_3 ---

Same reactant->TS1 umbrella-sampling PMF reconstruction as ../NNP_1/ and ../NNP_2/, driven
instead with committee member 'graph_3_004_compressed.pb' listed first in the LAMMPS
'pair_style deepmd' call (so it drives the dynamics; graph_1 and graph_2 are listed after it
for the committee deviation calculation only). Same rep_1/2/3 + average_PMF.py structure —
see ../NNP_1/README for the full file description.

Note: this README documents pre-existing content; no existing file was modified.
